<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>JUST TO PASS</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Noah Red</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">rise&amp;FALL</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6Zz0TDhChYCrDKPRmOyaIq</ttm:item><itunes:duration>03:13.000</itunes:duration></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.100" end="00:24.220">When the leaves meet the ground</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.220" end="00:27.010">Will you be there</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.010" end="00:32.470">Will you please make a sound</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.470" end="00:39.480">And when the dirt freezes cold</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.480" end="00:42.420">Will you disappear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.420" end="00:48.650">Along with all the mold</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.650" end="00:55.450">Coarse as rolling sand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.450" end="01:01.150">Was this part of the plan</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.150" end="01:04.910">Quiet in the fall</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.910" end="01:08.890">Whispering in the winter</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.890" end="01:12.650">Humming in the spring</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.650" end="01:16.470">Silent in the summer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.470" end="01:20.150">Whistling like the breeze</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.150" end="01:25.090">But rain turns to thunder</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.090" end="01:28.320">I wonder</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.320" end="01:34.170">What could've been</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.170" end="01:41.200">When the dew greets the sun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.200" end="01:44.140">Will you stack the stones</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.140" end="01:49.690">Or will you see only one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.690" end="01:56.520">And when the flowers bloom</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.520" end="01:59.530">Will I be gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.530" end="02:05.750">Decide to start anew?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.750" end="02:12.600">Sharp as broken glass</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.600" end="02:18.410">Walking just to pass</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.410" end="02:22.180">Quiet in the fall</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.180" end="02:26.060">Whispering in the winter</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.060" end="02:29.860">Humming in the spring</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.860" end="02:33.770">Silent in the summer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.770" end="02:37.420">Whistling like the breeze</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.420" end="02:42.190">But rain turns to thunder</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.190" end="02:45.610">I wonder</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.610" end="02:49.610">What could've been</p></div></body></tt>